{"seq":17,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-none-mu-memory/cn-05-coastal-date-formats/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T22:07:47.785Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"c1cee243e7dd37284178198c1e84393b8c4cd1bb66a04c429cfdf487020174e4","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#coastal-team","text":"Bettina Kroll: Moss's Coastal digest from Sun 2025-11-02 says Pellucid Harbor Logistics \"changes hands tomorrow, 2025-11-03\", so the handover date is 2025-11-03. That digest is the only source I found. It says ownership changes hands but doesn't name Kwame, and I can't see a contract or CRM record to confirm it. Also, \"PHL\" is also used for Covey & Lark Retail (now Pellow Home Living), so make sure the tracker row is the port-logistics account.","thread_ts":"1792159200.000127"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1792159200.000128","thread_ts":"1792159200.000127"}}
{"seq":18,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-none-mu-memory/cn-05-coastal-date-formats/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T22:07:49.945Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"f84cbdeba39daac6fd4f65a95f758cdcbf268be6ca145c86ded57097691dea48","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"I replied to Bettina in the #coastal-team thread. Moss's Coastal digest from Sunday 2025-11-02 says Pellucid Harbor Logistics \"changes hands tomorrow, 2025-11-03\", so the date is 2025-11-03.\n\nThat digest is the only source I found. It doesn't name Kwame as the new owner, and I couldn't see a contract or CRM record to confirm it.\n\nI also warned her that \"PHL\" is shared with Covey & Lark Retail, now Pellow Home Living. She should make sure the tracker row is the port-logistics account."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1792159200.000129"}}
